345
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:19,890
Three.

346
00:09:20,070 --> 00:09:21,800
There's only so much room
in there.

347
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,310
Bending compresses it.

348
00:09:23,450 --> 00:09:24,860
Straightening pulls it
tight.

349
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,150
That's the squeeze.

350
00:09:26,260 --> 00:09:26,870
Four.

351
00:09:26,910 --> 00:09:28,640
Red and near-infrared
light have been

352
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:30,960
